  message: "Cross-item review 2026-05-17: umbrella for the 19-of-21 linker-files missing Symbol.origin stamp. Per-file sibling items already filed on the corpus: INV-mopif (HTTP linker — kind=function bug surfaces origin='' as a symptom), INV-ronuf (WebSocket linker — phantom file-kind Symbols share the missing origin + missing stable_id), WI-higap (edge-side analog: 425 edges with empty origin_run_id, plus 1 edge with both origin AND origin_run_id empty from the same JS module linker file). When this lands, expect those three sibling items' origin-empty symptoms to clear; their other symptoms (wrong kind, phantom node, missing run_id) remain separate fixes."  # a46a
